flowchart LR
  C[Candidate bytes] --> S[review_start]
  S --> H[SHA-256 identity]
  H --> T{Risk tier}
  T -->|Tier 0| A[Approved fast path]
  T -->|Tier 1-3| R[Required review lenses]
  R --> V[Verification evidence]
  V --> F[review_finalize]
  F -->|Fresh and passing| A
  F -->|Missing, failed, or stale| B[Blocked]
  A --> G[Manual review_gate]
  M{Review mode} -->|managed| S
  M -->|disabled| U[Unmanaged / skipped]
  U -. never approved .-> G
